<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Uroquest cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Uroquest cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities cut its rating of UroQuest Medical Inc to hold from buy on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares hit a new 52-week low, falling 7/8 to 4-3/4.</p>
<p>-- The Salt Lake City, Utah company makes products to diagnose and treat urological orders such as incontinence and retention. It went public last October for $6 a share, well below expectations, and has traded as high as 10-1/4.</p>
</text>
